"evidence_tier":"sparse"}],"lead_score":null},"texts":{"cul:281-shepherds-purse":{"ref":"Culpeper, Complete Herbal: Shepherd’s Purse","headword":"Shepherd’s Purse","lang":"en","source":"culpeper","text":"It is under the dominion of Saturn, and of a cold, dry, and binding nature, like to him. It helps all fluxes of blood, either caused by inward or outward wounds; as also flux of the belly, and bloody flux, spitting blood, and bloody urine, stops the terms in women; being bound to the wrists of the hands, and the soles of the feet, it helps the yellow jaundice. The herb being made into a poultice, helps inflammations and St. Anthony’s fire. The juice being dropped into the ears, heals the pains, noise, and mutterings thereof. A good ointment may be made of it for all wounds, especially wounds in the head.","spans":[{"start":102,"end":117,"concept_id":"hemorrhage","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":154,"end":160,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":170,"end":187,"concept_id":"diarrhea","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":193,"end":204,"concept_id":"dysentery","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":206,"end":220,"concept_id":"hemoptysis","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":226,"end":238,"concept_id":"kidney_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":240,"end":255,"concept_id":"menorrhagia","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":353,"end":361,"concept_id":"jaundice","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":406,"end":419,"concept_id":"inflammation","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":428,"end":442,"concept_id":"erysipelas","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":468,"end":498,"concept_id":"ear_disease","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":573,"end":579,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"},{"start":592,"end":598,"concept_id":"wounds","polarity":"therapeutic"}]}},"gloss":{"cul:281-shepherds-purse":{"102":"fluxes of blood","154":"wounds (green, fresh, inward, old); wound-herb","170":"flux of the belly: diarrhoea","193":"bloody flux: dysentery","206":"spitting of blo